摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Push task-completion messages to the Huawei HarmonyOS assistant-today (负一屏) card feed from DeepSeek Harness — wire-compatible with the OpenClaw today-task skill.","id":"gh:1343840865","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-hiboard-push","slug":"QinpanWan/dsh-hiboard-push","topics":["dsh-plugin","harmonyos","hiboard","huawei","today-task"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Push task-completion messages to the Huawei HarmonyOS assistant-today (负一屏) card feed from DeepSeek "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Harness — wire-compatible with the OpenClaw today-task skill."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-hiboard-push"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Push task-completion messages to the Huawei HarmonyOS negative-one-screen\n(\"Today\" / 智慧助手·今天) as ser"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"vice cards, from a DeepSeek Harness (dsh)\nagent. Wire-compatible with the OpenClaw today-task\nskill:"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" the same HIBoard upload endpoint, the same payload contract, and the\nsame card rendering rules — so"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" the same authCode from 负一屏 works here too."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"When a task finishes, the agent calls `hiboard_push` with the task name and\nthe Markdown result; the"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" card appears on the phone's Today feed moments\nlater. No client UI, no extra runtime dependencies ("},{"id":"p4s3","text":"HTTP uses the Node\nbuilt-in `fetch`)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Linking tutorial (负一屏)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Three steps to connect dsh to your phone negative-one-screen feed:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 1. Get the authCode on your phone"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. Open 负一屏 (assistant-today) on the phone.\n2. 我的 → 动态管理 → 关联账号 → **Claw 智能体** → get the authorizati"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"on code.\n3. You get a code (e.g. `uhIzvTvjwnAD`). **Do not share it.**"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 2. Install the plugin"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 3. Configure the authCode from a terminal (recommended)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The code is stored in `~/.dsh/hiboard-auth.env` (mode 600, hidden from the\nsettings panel); the dsh "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"supervisor sources it on every launch:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Restart dsh to apply. Alternatives: the `hiboard-push` settings section\n(password-style input, field"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" marked `role(secret)` so it is redacted on the\nwire) or the environment variable:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Verify"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"In the dsh chat ask the agent to:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- Dry-run first: `call hiboard_push with dry_run` (validates, does not send).\n- Then a real connecti"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"on test: `call hiboard_verify` — the phone receives a\n\"dsh 连接测试\" card."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Once the card arrives, the link is live; the agent will call `hiboard_push`\nautomatically when tasks"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" card arrives, the link is live; the agent will call `hiboard_push`\nautomatically when tasks finish."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- `0000900034` invalid authCode: re-fetch from 负一屏 → 我的 → 动态管理 →\n关联账号 → Claw 智能体, then `dsh-hiboard-"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"auth new-code` and restart dsh.\n- The authCode is a personal credential: whoever holds it can push c"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ards to\nyour feed — never paste it into group chats or commit it to a repo.\n## Usage"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The plugin registers two tools:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### `hiboard_push`"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Parameter     | Required | Description                                                       |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `name`        | ✅       | Task name; card title, `scheduleTaskName`, and `summary`.        |\n| `co"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ntent`     | ✅       | Markdown body (≤ 5000 chars), rendered verbatim on the card.     |\n| `result`"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"      | ❌       | Result summary / status label. Default: `任务已完成`.            |\n| `schedule_id` | ❌ "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"      | Periodic-task ID; keep the same ID to group repeated cards.      |\n| `dry_run`     | ❌      "},{"id":"p27s5","text":" | Build and validate the payload without sending (no authCode needed). |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The card style follows which fields are filled (same as today-task):"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- **Standard task card** — `name` + `content` + `result`.\n- **Periodic task card** — the same, with "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"a `schedule_id`.\n- **Summary-only card** — `name` + `result` without `content`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### `hiboard_verify`"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Sends a minimal real connection-test card to the phone, to confirm the\nauthCode and network path end"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"minimal real connection-test card to the phone, to confirm the\nauthCode and network path end to end."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## API contract (for reference)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- Endpoint: `POST https://hiboard-claw-drcn.ai.dbankcloud.cn/distribution/message/cloud/claw/msg/upl"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"oad`\n- Headers: `Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8`,\n`x-trace-id: task-push-<yyyyMMddHHm"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"s: `Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8`,\n`x-trace-id: task-push-<yyyyMMddHHmmss>`\n- Body:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- Success: HTTP 200 with `\"code\": \"0000000000\"`.\n- `\"code\": \"0000900034\"` means the authCode is inva"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ccess: HTTP 200 with `\"code\": \"0000000000\"`.\n- `\"code\": \"0000900034\"` means the authCode is invalid."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
